# Shell scripts run on Linux (Cloud Shell, Run Command); CRLF breaks bash.
*.sh text eol=lf
# Hash-bound diagram assets: the render manifests hash their CRLF bytes. The blobs store those CRLF bytes
# and '-text' stops any conversion, so Git checkouts (any core.autocrlf), git archive / GitHub source ZIPs
# and the ZIP publisher all carry the hashed bytes (tests/test_architecture_assets.py). The generators
# write CRLF on every platform.
docs/diagrams/ccof-network-architecture.drawio -text
docs/diagrams/ccof-architecture-overview.svg -text
docs/diagrams/ccof-network-architecture.svg -text
docs/diagrams/dr-network-architecture.py -text
docs/images/dr/dr-active-passive.svg -text
docs/images/dr/dr-active-passive.excalidraw -text
